1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,050
This is Tuck.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,556
Tuck is a little turtle.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,709
Tuck loves sunny days.

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,355
Bye-bye, Sun!

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,167
The sun is going to bed.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,812
Here comes the dark.

7
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:25,361
Tuck is scared. He hides in his shell.

8
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:31,327
Inside, it is very dark.

9
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,858
Tap, tap! Who is that?

10
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:37,945
It is Firefly. "Come with me," she says.

11
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:42,264
Tuck takes one little step.

12
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:53,077
The dark is full of little lights!

13
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:57,628
Goodnight, little turtle.
